Subtract: (x-26)^2 - (x-40)^2 =700. Compute: (x^2-52x+676) - (x^2-80x+1600)=28x-924 =700 =>28x=1624 => x=58. Then y^2 =900 - (58-40)^2 =900-324=576 => y=±24. So G=(58,±24). Note x=58, E=57, so G almost above E.

