RTT \(=2 \times 270=540\text{ ms}\).

- \(N=1\): \(\frac{4096}{0.604}\approx 6.8\text{ kb/s}\)
- \(N=7\): \(\frac{7 \times 4096}{0.604}\approx 47.5\text{ kb/s}\)
