The operator is
\[
\vec P\cdot \vec n=\frac{\hbar}{2}(\sin\theta\,\sigma_x+\cos\theta\,\sigma_z)
=\frac{\hbar}{2}
\begin{pmatrix}
\cos\theta & \sin\theta\\
\sin\theta & -\cos\theta
\end{pmatrix}.
\]
For eigenvalue \(+\hbar/2\), the normalized eigenvector is
\[
\begin{pmatrix}
\cos(\theta/2)\\
\sin(\theta/2)
\end{pmatrix}.
\]

