\[
\left(\frac{1}{4}\right)^{10} \times \left(\frac{1}{4}\right)^{10}
= \left(\frac{1}{4}\right)^{20}
= \frac{1}{2^{40}}
\approx 9.095 \times 10^{-13}
\]

