Modulo \(125\), exponents reduce modulo \(100\):
\[
2^{2025}\equiv 32\pmod{100},\qquad 2^{2024}\equiv 16\pmod{100}.
\]
Thus
\[
2^{2^{2025}-3}\cdot 3^{2^{2024}+1}
\equiv 2^{29}\cdot 3^{17}\pmod{125}.
\]
Now
\[
2^{29}\equiv 37\pmod{125},\qquad 3^{17}\equiv 38\pmod{125},
\]
so
\[
37\cdot 38\equiv 31\pmod{125}.
\]
Therefore
\[
B_{2025}\equiv 8\cdot 31=248\pmod{1000}.
\]

